      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc36830799c74541325c88ef",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不擅长谈论自己的她，\n正在拼命寻找词汇。\n看来是想说非常重要的话。",
      "source_fingerprint": "98c2b806b3da5bc05cd9367d9df4a6b484ceadb0e122947eaadca2986b2d8696",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1089/storytimeline_501089314.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        22,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42934486967d6dce12fdb4fe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一边悠闲地走着，\n一边倾听高尚骏逸的话语。",
      "source_fingerprint": "37296c3a09f3b84a5d8711d542ae93721fdb7644533e851604680cd20ff270e8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1089/storytimeline_501089314.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1b41438fbd61e2f22e108f4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——话题从出道当时的事情开始了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f75be0b7b8be4dc5118c097a707e5adb597a0c8c55e8aaae9654a345ae87c4d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1089/storytimeline_501089314.json",
      "json_path": [
